<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-COMPAGNONI WINS GIANT SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-COMPAGNONI WINS GIANT SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colorado 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Cup giant slalom champion Deborah Compagnoni of Italy won the women's giant slalom at the World Cup Finals on Saturday, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Katja Seizinger of Germany finished second and Karin Roten of Switzerland was third.</p>
<p>The results were later declared official.</p>
</text>
